Confirmed: `recreate` moves every swapchain image to PRESENT_SRC in a submission that runs before any `vkAcquireNextImageKHR`, and the layer flags it. Before choosing a fix, I need to see how `run_immediate` and the frame sync submission pass waits and signals.
